WEBVTT

00:03.050 --> 00:05.790
<i>I worked as a salaryman 
for a toxic company,</i>

00:05.790 --> 00:07.530
<i>until I reincarnated...</i>

00:07.530 --> 00:11.570
<i>in a crazy world where everything is 
dropped by monsters in dungeons.</i>

00:12.170 --> 00:15.620
<i>In my new life, I'm level 1, 
but I have a unique skill</i>

00:15.620 --> 00:19.520
<i>that puts all of my drop rates at rank S.</i>

00:20.150 --> 00:22.070
<i>And then I met...</i>

00:22.420 --> 00:24.920
<i>an insanely huge gorilla?!</i>

00:25.610 --> 00:29.610
<i>What kinds of rare items could
 I get for defeating this thing?!</i>

00:30.780 --> 00:31.880
Yes?

00:32.930 --> 00:34.660
The girl from before...

00:36.700 --> 00:38.630
I hate low levels.

00:38.630 --> 00:41.800
Uh, was it really necessary 
to come to my house for that?

00:42.500 --> 00:44.470
What? You need something?

00:45.620 --> 00:47.160
I wuv you.

00:47.440 --> 00:48.220
Wha...

00:48.510 --> 00:51.070
What?!

00:51.070 --> 00:51.740
Huh?

00:58.120 --> 01:07.250
<b>My Unique Skill Makes <b>Me OP
Even at Level 1</b></b>

02:21.990 --> 02:27.000
<b>Dead or Carrot</b>

02:27.570 --> 02:30.160
Yoda? Who was that?

02:30.160 --> 02:32.970
That's... what <i>I</i> want to know.

02:32.970 --> 02:36.890
Do bunny girls live in this 
world like regular people?

02:42.830 --> 02:45.810
What the heck?! Cut it out! I'm your—

02:49.910 --> 02:53.400
I did the same thing to you, 
and you're low-level, but you're alive.

02:53.400 --> 02:55.620
That's what you just did to me?!

02:55.620 --> 02:57.670
You're low-level. So why?

02:57.670 --> 02:59.790
W-Well, I mean...

02:59.790 --> 03:02.500
<i>Probably because my HP is at rank S?</i>

03:03.450 --> 03:05.730
Why did you come here, anyway?

03:07.490 --> 03:08.670
This.

03:09.230 --> 03:11.070
I got it in the dungeon.

03:30.510 --> 03:33.750
I want more amayzing carrots like this!

03:37.190 --> 03:38.940
There!

03:39.350 --> 03:41.390
I wuv carrots!

03:43.410 --> 03:46.000
Hey, those are ours...

03:46.740 --> 03:48.760
Would you like to eat them with us?

03:55.390 --> 03:57.980
First, we peel the carrots.

04:00.670 --> 04:05.060
Then we slice and cut them 
into carrot noodles.

04:06.450 --> 04:10.290
Then boil them just enough that
 they keep their crunchiness...

04:11.600 --> 04:15.050
Then we make a sauce from 
the carrot leaves and flesh.

04:16.630 --> 04:18.750
Once we add that to the noodles,

04:18.750 --> 04:22.450
we have three-color carrot 
noodles with carrot sauce.

04:22.450 --> 04:27.120
Enjoy it with a soup made using 
both bean sprouts and carrots.

04:30.780 --> 04:33.050
Time to eat!

04:34.110 --> 04:36.140
The soup smells great, too!

04:36.140 --> 04:38.120
Those are your natural ears, huh?

04:39.550 --> 04:41.350
So dewicious!

04:41.640 --> 04:43.480
This really is good.

04:43.480 --> 04:45.110
You must be a god!

04:45.110 --> 04:47.720
I get why you'd say that.

04:47.720 --> 04:50.180
Emily's cooking is god-rank.

04:50.180 --> 04:51.770
You're too kind.

04:51.770 --> 04:56.680
But I made lots, so eat all you like.

04:58.500 --> 05:00.110
I'm stuffed.

05:00.770 --> 05:02.770
Thank you for the meal.

05:06.380 --> 05:06.980
Bye.

05:06.980 --> 05:09.090
Huh? Oh... Bye, then.

05:09.090 --> 05:10.990
Come visit us again!

05:11.520 --> 05:12.970
I will.

05:17.840 --> 05:19.450
What was that all about?

05:19.940 --> 05:22.360
We didn't even get her name.

05:22.790 --> 05:23.970
Yoda...

05:24.390 --> 05:25.940
Thank you.

05:25.940 --> 05:26.710
Huh?

05:27.550 --> 05:31.430
Before I moved in here, I always ate alone.

05:32.370 --> 05:37.070
So getting to eat here with you and a guest

05:37.070 --> 05:39.070
makes me really happy.

05:42.080 --> 05:43.390
<i>I was the same.</i>

05:44.040 --> 05:46.900
<i>I always ate alone, too.</i>

05:49.630 --> 05:50.890
Yoda...

05:51.870 --> 05:55.280
Let's always eat our meals 
together from now on.

05:57.080 --> 05:58.090
Sure!

06:02.420 --> 06:08.840
<b>Nihonium Level 2</b>

06:04.840 --> 06:08.120
<i>I gained such a warm, cozy life 
after coming to this world.</i>

06:08.850 --> 06:11.010
<i>And to protect that...</i>

06:16.220 --> 06:18.320
<i>I want to get stronger!</i>

06:19.980 --> 06:22.310
Oh, crap! My only weapon!

06:25.840 --> 06:29.320
It doesn't hurt since my HP is rank S...

06:29.610 --> 06:31.990
But it's gross as hell!

06:37.250 --> 06:40.280
<i>I wish I had a long-range weapon!</i>

06:51.240 --> 06:54.170
The first dungeon level raised my HP.

06:54.790 --> 06:56.300
What about the second?

07:01.060 --> 07:03.940
m 0 0 l -54 0 l -58 -4 l -58 -38 l -54 -42 l -38 -42 l -38 -40 l -54 -40 l -56 -38 l -56 -4 l -54 -2 l 0 -2

07:01.060 --> 07:03.940
m 0 0 l -54 0 l -58 -4 l -58 -38 l -54 -42 l -38 -42 l -38 -40 l -54 -40 l -56 -38 l -56 -4 l -54 -2 l 0 -2

07:01.060 --> 07:03.940
Ryota's strength increased by 1.

07:01.520 --> 07:04.150
<i>Ryota's strength increased by 1.</i>

07:04.150 --> 07:05.540
It's strength!

07:10.810 --> 07:12.680
Wh-What are you doing there?!

07:15.130 --> 07:16.520
What was that?

07:16.520 --> 07:17.350
Huh?

07:17.350 --> 07:19.090
That drop.

07:19.090 --> 07:20.180
Oh...

07:20.620 --> 07:23.730
<i>Everyone else thinks nothing 
is dropped in Nihonium.</i>

07:23.730 --> 07:27.030
<i>But since my drop rank is S, 
I get stat boosts.</i>

07:27.030 --> 07:30.170
<i>I'd rather not tell her that 
if I don't have to...</i>

07:31.100 --> 07:33.970
Stare...

07:32.440 --> 07:33.970
Don't say that out loud.

07:33.970 --> 07:35.750
Got carrots yet?

07:36.830 --> 07:38.440
That's what you want?

07:38.750 --> 07:40.940
If you don't have carrots...

07:41.780 --> 07:43.350
I-If I don't?

07:43.970 --> 07:46.260
Dead or carrot?

07:46.260 --> 07:48.600
My life depends on this?!

07:48.600 --> 07:52.400
Can't get carrots here. 
Let's hurry to Telulu.

07:52.400 --> 07:55.200
All right. We'll go to Telulu later.

07:55.450 --> 07:56.540
Really?!

07:56.540 --> 08:00.200
Yeah. Wait for me at 
the Swallow's Gratitude.

08:00.780 --> 08:02.110
Okay!

08:03.920 --> 08:06.310
So, as long as there are carrots...

08:06.830 --> 08:09.130
that's... all she needs?

08:12.190 --> 08:14.890
<i>After my strength ranked up from F to D,</i>

08:14.890 --> 08:17.360
<i>slimes got a lot easier to kill,</i>

08:17.360 --> 08:19.390
<i>and I got a lot more carrots.</i>

08:26.650 --> 08:27.730
There she is.

08:28.560 --> 08:29.720
Who's that?

08:29.720 --> 08:33.570
He's insane! No one just 
walks up to the Killing Rabbit!

08:34.370 --> 08:35.730
Here's your carrot.

08:36.330 --> 08:39.520
Does he even realize what he's doing?!

08:39.520 --> 08:40.410
What?

08:41.720 --> 08:43.840
I wuv carrots!

08:44.930 --> 08:48.240
He found carrots that 
carrot junkie will accept?!

08:53.200 --> 08:55.060
What the heck is with you?

08:55.060 --> 08:56.690
R-Ryota!

08:57.300 --> 08:59.830
You're acquainted with this girl?

08:59.830 --> 09:01.510
Oh, Erza.

09:01.510 --> 09:04.920
Well, I don't know if I'd say "acquainted"...

09:05.290 --> 09:07.180
Here's your dinner.

09:06.620 --> 09:10.830
Wuv! Wuv! Wuv!

09:07.180 --> 09:10.250
I gave her some carrots, 
and now she likes me.

09:10.250 --> 09:13.000
What?!

09:14.220 --> 09:18.520
Ryota! I'll buy these carrots 
for double the retail value!

09:18.520 --> 09:20.690
Double?! B-But why?

09:20.690 --> 09:23.860
You didn't know? This girl...

09:24.380 --> 09:27.550
Her name is Eve Callusleader.

09:27.550 --> 09:32.000
She's an adventurer whose trademark is her 
natural bunny ears and bunny girl look.

09:32.000 --> 09:36.930
They say her killer move, Excalibur, 
can cleave a boulder in half!

09:37.880 --> 09:40.140
She's also famous as a carrot sommelier,

09:40.140 --> 09:43.180
and among the dungeons in 
the vicinity of Secro,

09:43.180 --> 09:46.670
there are carrot levels that
 no one but her can conquer!

09:47.860 --> 09:50.520
Her catchphrase is "dead or carrot."

09:50.930 --> 09:53.500
They say people have actually been killed

09:53.500 --> 09:56.140
because they gave her bad-tasting carrots!

09:56.820 --> 09:59.320
That's too much information...

09:59.320 --> 10:01.800
So any carrot that gets 
Eve's seal of approval

10:01.800 --> 10:04.530
is sure to sell for a higher price!

10:04.530 --> 10:09.220
And we at the Swallow's Gratitude 
would do anything to get them!

10:10.150 --> 10:13.140
I'll take them for 15,000 pilos each!

10:13.420 --> 10:17.200
15,000 times 30...

10:17.200 --> 10:19.800
If I keep this up for a month, 
that's 450,000 pilos!

10:20.340 --> 10:22.230
I have to thank her!

10:23.270 --> 10:25.020
Carrots before thanks.

10:27.040 --> 10:28.890
Carrots, please.

10:28.890 --> 10:30.500
My time's up for today!

10:30.500 --> 10:32.310
I'm done! You'll get more tomorrow!

10:32.310 --> 10:34.690
No! I hate you, Low-Level!

10:35.600 --> 10:36.660
Whoa.

10:39.570 --> 10:43.650
My name isn't Low-Level. It's Sato Ryota.

10:43.650 --> 10:45.030
Where are my carrots?

10:45.030 --> 10:48.940
Sorry. I promised Emily I'd stop 
working by a certain time.

10:49.380 --> 10:51.770
I promise I'll give you 
more carrots tomorrow.

10:52.820 --> 10:54.790
Dead or carrot.

10:54.790 --> 10:56.620
<i>Uh, yeah.</i>

10:56.620 --> 10:58.230
Dead or carrot.

10:58.940 --> 11:00.280
Okay.

11:00.280 --> 11:02.390
See you tomorrow, Eve.

11:09.810 --> 11:11.720
More carrots tomorrow!

11:14.270 --> 11:22.660
<b>My Unique Skill Makes <b>Me OP
Even at Level 1</b></b>

11:14.270 --> 11:22.660
<b>My Unique Skill Makes <b>Me OP
Even at Level 1</b></b>

11:14.660 --> 11:18.810
Ca...r...ro...t!

11:19.290 --> 11:22.450
Wuv, wuv, wuv, wuv, wuv!

11:22.450 --> 11:23.490
Carrots!

11:23.990 --> 11:26.410
<b>Telulu Level 2</b>

11:26.630 --> 11:29.340
Looks like we'll get another 
great haul today.

11:29.340 --> 11:31.050
I'm gonna go take a look over there.

11:31.050 --> 11:32.270
Okay.

11:35.630 --> 11:36.700
There it goes!

11:36.700 --> 11:37.750
I know!

11:48.840 --> 11:49.930
Hang in there!

11:51.320 --> 11:53.510
What is going on here?!

11:56.650 --> 11:58.460
Sorry, Captain...

12:01.970 --> 12:03.300
Captain?

12:08.830 --> 12:11.320
<i>He's strong... But...</i>

12:13.490 --> 12:15.700
All right, on to the next one!

12:17.320 --> 12:21.840
Sorry... Please let us rest... 
for just a bit...

12:22.320 --> 12:24.710
We haven't had a break in two days...

12:26.070 --> 12:26.920
Weaklings!

12:28.040 --> 12:29.830
When I was a young man,

12:29.830 --> 12:33.140
I could spend weeks on end 
in a dungeon like this!

12:33.140 --> 12:35.780
And that's how I got this strong!

12:35.780 --> 12:38.780
But we've barely had any sleep...

12:38.780 --> 12:42.180
I'm doing this to help you two!

12:42.180 --> 12:44.200
To help... us?

12:44.200 --> 12:47.860
Yes! You will get stronger, without fail!

12:47.860 --> 12:52.210
I'm being strict with you 
because I believe in you!

12:52.210 --> 12:55.270
Do you two not believe in me?!

12:57.510 --> 12:58.890
Captain...

12:58.890 --> 13:00.370
We're sorry.

13:00.370 --> 13:03.390
As long as you understand. Let's go.

13:03.390 --> 13:04.240
Yes, sir.

13:08.810 --> 13:11.160
<i>I wish I hadn't seen that.</i>

13:12.020 --> 13:15.940
<b>A Shot of Fighting Spirit</b>

13:12.240 --> 13:15.060
<i>I had a boss like that at my old job.</i>

13:15.930 --> 13:18.350
<i>He'd give us impossible tasks</i>

13:15.940 --> 13:21.860
<b>A Shot of Fighting Spirit</b>

13:18.350 --> 13:20.560
<i>and say it was for our own sakes.</i>

13:21.860 --> 13:23.680
I guess guys like that are everywhere.

13:24.090 --> 13:25.420
Yoda?

13:26.890 --> 13:28.790
Is something wrong?

13:28.790 --> 13:30.940
You look pale.

13:32.140 --> 13:33.620
It's nothing.

13:33.950 --> 13:37.210
Let's take a break! We'll eat lunch!

13:42.880 --> 13:45.480
This looks great! Let's eat!

13:47.850 --> 13:50.730
Emily's lunches!

13:50.730 --> 13:51.500
There she is.

13:51.500 --> 13:52.430
Carrots...

13:52.430 --> 13:54.640
Would you like to eat with us, Eve?

13:54.950 --> 13:57.050
I tried making carrot pudding.

13:57.050 --> 13:58.690
Carrot pudding?!

13:58.690 --> 14:01.250
Yummy!

14:04.960 --> 14:06.920
Hey, this is good, too!

14:06.920 --> 14:10.820
It's fragrant, and the breading 
is a bit sweet. It's amazing!

14:10.820 --> 14:13.840
I used sweet potato flour in the breading.

14:13.840 --> 14:15.990
The spices I used are a secret.

14:15.990 --> 14:17.300
Wow.

14:17.300 --> 14:19.390
Hmm, what's next?

14:19.390 --> 14:21.240
This has carrots in it, too.

14:21.240 --> 14:22.920
I'll take it!

14:24.060 --> 14:26.050
<i>This feels so nice.</i>

14:26.050 --> 14:30.210
<i>I just feel so... I don't know...
 relaxed right now.</i>

14:30.890 --> 14:33.630
Don't turn out like that, you two.

14:34.190 --> 14:39.940
To show such laziness in a 
sacred dungeon is inexcusable.

14:42.510 --> 14:45.290
Even the items dropped 
here possess spirits,

14:45.290 --> 14:47.630
and the effort you put in 
affects their quality.

14:47.630 --> 14:51.280
The drops found by those lazy slugs 
will be of the worst quality.

14:54.460 --> 14:56.040
Eat carrots!

15:04.660 --> 15:05.710
What is this?!

15:05.710 --> 15:06.780
It's so good!

15:08.980 --> 15:10.780
Hey, you two!

15:10.780 --> 15:12.650
I hate those who misunderstand carrots.

15:12.650 --> 15:13.340
What?!

15:13.340 --> 15:16.300
Carrots are delicious, 
even without hard work.

15:16.300 --> 15:17.500
You—

15:19.730 --> 15:22.140
Low-Level's carrots are the best.

15:25.910 --> 15:27.690
Let's go, you two!

15:34.910 --> 15:37.160
Time to eat carrots!

15:43.010 --> 15:45.160
Thanks, Eve.

15:48.940 --> 15:51.940
Carrots tomorrow, too! More carrots!

15:51.940 --> 15:53.020
Yeah, sure.

15:58.350 --> 16:01.000
Thank you for bringing so many again today!

16:01.280 --> 16:04.200
We actually got more drops than that,

16:04.200 --> 16:06.160
but this was all we could carry.

16:06.160 --> 16:09.520
You don't have a magic cart?

16:09.520 --> 16:10.960
A magic cart?

16:11.610 --> 16:13.070
One of those.

16:17.370 --> 16:20.370
With a magic cart, 
you can carry more items,

16:20.370 --> 16:22.780
increasing production efficiency.

16:22.780 --> 16:25.700
Wow, that sounds great!

16:26.000 --> 16:28.090
Want to buy a magic cart?

16:28.090 --> 16:31.180
Yeah. It sounds like 
it'll be handy to have.

16:36.860 --> 16:40.370
Is this the magic cart shop 
Erza was talking about?

16:41.960 --> 16:43.600
Welcome!

16:43.600 --> 16:45.420
Hello there.

16:45.420 --> 16:48.750
Um... Is your mom or dad here?

16:48.750 --> 16:51.020
Daddy's in the back, doing modding.

16:51.020 --> 16:52.860
Modding?

16:52.860 --> 16:55.190
Daddy! Customers!

16:56.440 --> 17:00.870
Ah, Olga. What a good girl, 
keeping an eye on the shop.

17:02.940 --> 17:04.240
Ah, welcome.

17:04.240 --> 17:06.860
We'd like a magic cart.

17:06.860 --> 17:10.780
Oh, then I've got just the thing for you.

17:10.780 --> 17:12.870
This is what I recommend.

17:12.870 --> 17:15.710
It comes with a monster detection system.

17:15.710 --> 17:17.540
That sounds handy.

17:17.540 --> 17:18.630
It does!

17:19.000 --> 17:22.930
Yep. I modded it myself, 
so I can guarantee it works.

17:23.310 --> 17:26.500
Oh, that's what she meant by "modding."

17:26.500 --> 17:28.080
So what's it cost?

17:28.080 --> 17:29.910
Ten million pilos.

17:29.910 --> 17:31.810
Ten million?!

17:31.810 --> 17:35.610
Well, you could buy a regular one 
for two or three million...

17:35.610 --> 17:38.240
Still, they cost that much?

17:38.240 --> 17:40.470
But regular ones are no fun.

17:40.470 --> 17:42.640
There's one I'm testing out right now,

17:42.640 --> 17:45.650
and I'm planning to give it 
even more handy features.

17:45.650 --> 17:48.910
Just wait until that one's done.

17:51.800 --> 17:55.650
Well, there's no way we can 
afford a magic cart right now,

17:55.650 --> 17:57.700
but we'll save up until we can.

17:57.700 --> 18:00.340
Yes! For now, we'll go 
home and have dinner.

18:00.340 --> 18:02.780
I bet Eve will show up again.

18:02.780 --> 18:04.760
I'll make something with carrots in it.

18:05.120 --> 18:06.830
It's a stray!

18:08.890 --> 18:10.270
Run!

18:10.270 --> 18:11.340
Help!

18:11.340 --> 18:13.180
A stray!

18:13.180 --> 18:14.740
What's a stray?

18:15.100 --> 18:19.480
A kind of monster that appears when 
you leave drops in parts of dungeons

18:19.480 --> 18:21.030
where there aren't any people.

18:21.420 --> 18:22.650
A monster?

18:30.160 --> 18:31.300
A gorilla?!

18:35.550 --> 18:36.860
Get out of here!

18:37.810 --> 18:40.080
It's coming this way!

18:39.520 --> 18:40.380
Mom, wait!

18:40.380 --> 18:42.220
Help!

18:42.220 --> 18:43.980
Even adventurers are running away!

18:43.980 --> 18:47.550
Strays don't drop any items.

18:47.550 --> 18:50.910
Most people don't want to fight 
them because it's not worth it.

18:51.790 --> 18:53.310
So they just...

18:54.300 --> 18:56.760
Daddy! I'm scared!

18:56.760 --> 18:58.470
It'll be all right, Olga!

19:00.010 --> 19:02.410
You two better should run away, too!

19:13.660 --> 19:16.090
R-Ryota?!

19:20.630 --> 19:22.280
<i>If this keeps up...</i>

19:22.280 --> 19:23.770
Out of the way, Low-Level!

19:31.640 --> 19:32.900
Thank you.

19:32.900 --> 19:34.220
You okay, Erza?

19:34.220 --> 19:35.110
Yes.

19:36.490 --> 19:37.570
But...

19:42.080 --> 19:44.020
Our town is...

19:49.580 --> 19:51.670
I'm going to kill the stray.

19:51.670 --> 19:52.460
Huh?!

19:52.460 --> 19:56.550
Don't worry. I won't let 
it destroy our town!

19:56.550 --> 19:58.030
I'm going with you!

20:05.960 --> 20:08.130
I can't even get close to it!

20:08.130 --> 20:11.110
I'll go! All of you, keep it where it is!

20:11.110 --> 20:14.350
Huh? And who the heck are 
you to talk like that?!

20:14.890 --> 20:16.230
Reckless.

20:16.230 --> 20:18.520
Don't blame me for what happens, Low-Level!

20:18.520 --> 20:20.700
It's fine! Just leave this to me!

20:27.530 --> 20:28.480
Take that!

20:30.090 --> 20:31.680
Thanks, Emily!

20:33.840 --> 20:34.900
Eve!

20:37.180 --> 20:38.200
Thanks!

20:48.620 --> 20:49.680
Yoda?!

20:49.680 --> 20:53.970
Don't underestimate my skill!

21:05.330 --> 21:07.500
It's over...

21:07.500 --> 21:08.960
Indeed!

21:08.960 --> 21:11.370
Cheeky, for a low-level.

21:14.280 --> 21:15.510
Thank you!

21:15.510 --> 21:16.910
That was amazing!

21:16.050 --> 21:18.740
You saved us all!

21:16.910 --> 21:18.930
What a man!

21:18.740 --> 21:20.150
Thank you!

21:18.930 --> 21:20.130
You're the town hero!

21:20.150 --> 21:25.340
Ryota, thank you for protecting 
the town of Secro!

